### Conversation Analysis Section

The main analysis area with AI-powered insights:

<Tabs>
  <Tab title="Warning Banner">
    **Important information about AI analysis**
    
    Yellow banner states:
    > "Please note that conversation analysis results are estimates generated by AI and may vary between different analysis runs. The maximum number of conversations to analyze is 250."
    
    <Info>
    This means each time you run an analysis, the AI may provide slightly different insights based on its interpretation of the conversations.
    </Info>
  </Tab>
  
  <Tab title="Advanced Settings">
    **Configure analysis parameters**
    
    Click the **Advanced Settings** dropdown to access:
    - **Custom Keywords**: Comma-separated keywords to track specifically
    - Analysis depth options
    - Focus areas
    - Output preferences
    
    <Info>
    **Custom Keywords Feature:**
    
    Specify keywords (separated by commas) for the analyzer to track in both INPUT (user messages) and OUTPUT (agent responses). These keywords are tracked in addition to automatically discovered keywords.
    
    **Example:** `inteligencia artificial, accesibilidad, eLearning, aprendizaje, herramientas`
    
    Results show:
    - **Occurrence count**: How many times each keyword appeared
    - **Relevance percentage**: % of conversations where the keyword is relevant
    </Info>
    
    <Tip>
    Use custom keywords to track specific terms important to your business, brand, or compliance requirements.
    </Tip>
  </Tab>
  
  <Tab title="Run New Analysis">
    **Generate fresh insights**
    
    The green **"Run New Analysis"** button triggers:
    - AI processing of filtered conversations
    - Pattern identification
    - Insight generation
    - Trend analysis
    - Issue detection
  </Tab>
</Tabs>

